WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:04.340
If you want to hear the truth about the gamer
girl bathwater AIDS scandal, then stick around

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:05.860
to the end of this video.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.760
[intro]

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:14.140
Hello, and welcome to another exciting lesson
here on Horror History.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:16.980
My name is Light Yagami, and today we’re
going to be looking at one of Pennywise’s

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:21.410
most trusted allies, a so called gamer girl
with ties to Satan, whose publicity stunts

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:25.770
and money making schemes have taken the internet
by storm on multiple occasions; who has battled

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:30.590
massive entities like Mark Zuckerberg, The
Brighton Police Department and PewDiePie;

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:34.050
and whose bravery and valiant efforts saved
the life of a hamster one time -- I am of

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.040
course referring to Belle Delphine.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.540
In order to understand how she came to be,
we’ve got to start at the beginning, so

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:41.900
let’s take it back to the birth of Belle.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.850
[HORROR HISTORY]

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:48.520
Mary-Belle Kirschner was born on October 23rd,
1999 in Cape Town, South Africa.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:52.399
She was born with a dislocated hip that required
extensive surgery, which likely saved her

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.020
from a life confined to a wheelchair and gave
her the ability to do this.

00:00:56.020 --> 00:01:02.699
🎵 All Star - Smash Mouth 🎵

00:01:02.699 --> 00:01:06.740
Kirschner’s father was Caucasian man who
married multiracial Japanese woman and by

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:09.539
the time of their daughter’s birth, they
were living in South Africa.

00:01:09.539 --> 00:01:13.179
The Japanese heritage of Belle’s mother
likely had a large impact on her interests

00:01:13.179 --> 00:01:16.719
culturally, because she’s known for her
anime-style cosplays which include anime and

00:01:16.719 --> 00:01:20.619
Japanese video game characters, and perhaps
her most notable pose in these photographs,

00:01:20.619 --> 00:01:23.729
is her ahegao faces, which are a staple of
Japanese Hentai.

00:01:23.729 --> 00:01:28.279
She’s also been known to sketch illustrations
of manga and Japanese video game characters.

00:01:28.279 --> 00:01:31.359
Her mother’s influence on her life may have
stretched further than that though, in an

00:01:31.359 --> 00:01:35.469
Instagram Q&amp;A, Belle revealed that her mother
has taken some work as a model, and that this

00:01:35.469 --> 00:01:38.240
experience made her mom more accepting of
her career choice.

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:42.219
I wouldn’t be surprised if this worked both
ways and Mrs. Kirschner’s early modeling

00:01:42.219 --> 00:01:44.569
work helped inspire some of Belle’s thottery.

00:01:44.569 --> 00:01:48.180
As a young girl, Belle spent a lot of time
exploring outdoors and loved hiking mountain

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:52.469
areas and beaches, so when she moved to Brighton
in the United Kingdom and didn’t have easy

00:01:52.469 --> 00:01:56.679
access to these scenic areas in nature, she
took to the internet to entertain herself.

00:01:56.679 --> 00:02:00.559
It was here that Belle would realize the power
of the internet, but she did not yet know

00:02:00.559 --> 00:02:04.200
of the extent at which the world wide web
would alter the course of her life.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:09.159
Belle showed the wit, intelligence, and creativity
that she would later use to build a $500,000

00:02:09.159 --> 00:02:12.379
business early on in her school days, where
she was constantly at the top of her class

00:02:12.379 --> 00:02:16.819
in nearly every subject with the exception
of English, and if her Patreon page is any

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:20.180
indication, she hasn’t been able to improve
her English skills in the years that would

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:20.740
follow.

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:24.280
Screenshooting is not a word, there’s a
comma missing after ‘hamsters’, there

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:28.340
should not be a comma here and that’s the
worst use of an apostrophe I’ve ever seen.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:32.510
“You’re my king and you’re helping me
unbelievable, thank you so so much.”

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:36.159
It is possible that the grammatical
errors on her Patreon are part of the Lolita

00:02:36.159 --> 00:02:39.659
aspect of her character, but I’ll get back
to that when we get there.

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:43.159
First, Belle would demonstrate her drive to
be successful and make money by beginning

00:02:43.159 --> 00:02:47.629
her first job at the age of 13, and she worked
many jobs from a young age, including being

00:02:47.629 --> 00:02:50.410
a barista, a dishwasher and a waitress among
others.

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:54.409
I find it interesting that waitress was among
the jobs that she held, even at the young

00:02:54.409 --> 00:02:58.590
age of 13, because it’s one of the few professions
in English culture where an employee who plays

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:01.860
their cards right can typically make a few
extra pounds from customer tipping.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:05.230
“In England, where I’m from tipping
is seen as optional.”

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:08.239
I wouldn’t be surprised if she picked up
a few tips and tricks, pun definitely intended,

00:03:08.239 --> 00:03:12.650
that she could use to make some extra money
in another tip-friendly venture of hers down

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:14.260
the line, her Premium Snapchat.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:18.260
The year following her 14th birthday in 2013
was a life changing one.

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:21.969
She dropped out of school, started her own
Facebook page which she named “tinkersmell”,

00:03:21.969 --> 00:03:25.599
which she would use to share selfies of herself
and friends online, and started a relationship

00:03:25.599 --> 00:03:26.810
with a girl named Hannah.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:29.760
The relationship with Hannah, along with the
fact that she’d abandoned her education,

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:33.859
may have been a contributing factor to her
leaving home a year later at the age of 15

00:03:33.859 --> 00:03:35.420
to move into a shared household.

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:39.680
It was here that she started her first Instagram
account and on March 27th, 2015, she would

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:44.640
make her debut on the gram, which would eventually
become her most successful social media account.

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:48.290
This also marked an aesthetic change, which
featured most goth looking photographs with

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:52.540
piercings and fake tattoos -- she seemed to
be heavily influenced by the style of alternative

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:53.990
pop artist Melanie Martinez.

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:57.530
Belle’s relationship with Hannah would go
on another year after that, but when Belle

00:03:57.530 --> 00:03:58.849
was 16 it was over.

00:03:58.849 --> 00:04:02.700
It was also around this time that the stage
name “Belle Delphine” was adopted and

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:06.269
she began to make a more conscious effort
to brand herself in a specific way.

00:04:06.269 --> 00:04:10.099
I think this was the most important moment
in her career: the moment that Mary-Belle

00:04:10.099 --> 00:04:12.950
Kirschner died, and Belle Delphine was born.

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:17.280
This was more than just a name change, this
was the creation of a character, and the portrayal

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:20.690
of this wacky character is the reason that
she is successful today.

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:24.550
Belle realized that on social media, your
most valuable asset is the attention of your

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:28.889
audience, and having an outlandish character,
an exaggerated extension of oneself, is an

00:04:28.889 --> 00:04:30.920
effective way to garner that attention.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:34.810
Combine that with the increasingly revealing
outfits in her posts, and Belle Delphine had

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:38.800
a recipe for success, but it would take some
time before her first big breakthrough.

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.130
In the meantime, she took up babysitting.

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:43.841
Now I don’t know what parents took a look
at Belle Delphine and decided, “you know

00:04:43.841 --> 00:04:44.841
what?

00:04:44.841 --> 00:04:46.150
I think we should hire her to look after our
baby.”

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:47.580
I mean roll the clip.

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:50.600
“And here is my lovely doll.

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:54.340
So I actually put my actual human hair.

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:56.840
I’ve also got some baby arms.

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:57.870
And some baby legs.”

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:00.710
But to be fair, that clip wasn’t online
at the time she was babysitting.

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:05.449
She started her YouTube channel on July 30th
2016 and in August she would post her only

00:05:05.449 --> 00:05:09.690
video of that year, a makeup tutorial that
seems to be nothing more than a makeup tutorial

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:12.100
that would bring in 90K views through it’s
first two years.

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:17.610
“Hi, I’m Belle and today I’m
gonna be doing my everyday eye makeup for

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:18.610
you.”

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:22.360
But like great character actor YouTubers like
Daxflame and MirandaSings before her, I think

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:26.169
she realized that she had to start off a little
bit normal and show us that descent into the

00:05:26.169 --> 00:05:29.400
occasionally morbid kawaii e-girl that we know
