00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:00.400
In the photo...

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:00.940
is that a plane?

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:02.660
**** that's a plane

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:08.200
In the photos leading up to October 17th,
