00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:44.060
“I’ve also got my lolita book.”

00:06:44.060 --> 00:06:46.990
And it just seems like she feels that’s
an important part of the character, because

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:51.990
despite marketing herself as an adult symbol,
she never technically crosses into adult content,

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:55.800
instead opting to do memes and just straight
up weird stuff, like the whole thing is really

00:06:55.800 --> 00:07:00.229
