00:07:01.849 --> 00:07:03.819
[heavy breathing cat]

00:07:03.819 --> 00:07:07.410
But I think that’s kind of what makes the
next two years of her story so funny, is that

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:11.120
there’s just like this sharp contrast between
what she claims to be and what she’s actually

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.849
doing, because immediately after getting the
free braces, she starts posting the ahegao

00:07:14.849 --> 00:07:18.150
photos, and if you’re not familiar with
Japanese culture, ahegao is basically this

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:22.569
