Belle Delphine.

00:12:57.350 --> 00:13:00.640
Marzia: Pizza time stop--”

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:06.830
The videos on the Hub would bring in between
300K and 3.6M views at the time of recording,

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:10.830
and more importantly, it got a lot of people
talking about Belle Delphine, however, there

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:13.120
would be one unintended side effect.

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:17.720
Later that month, the hand of Mark Zuckerberg
taketh away, and Instagram struck down her

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:18.720
account.

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:22.300
This had a deep emotional toll on the 19 year
old social media star.

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:23.570
Actually, I made that up.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:25.610
Why the **** am I even making this video?

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:30.100
But her next big business venture, which would
become her biggest business venture, was right

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.100
around the corner.

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:36.250
On July 3rd, 2019, Belle Delphine announced
on Twitter: “I am now selling my bath water!

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:42.060
this is what humanity has come to :) get yours
here...www.belledelphinestore.com”.

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:46.120
The bathwater, which went for $30 at the time
sold out in under 8 hours.

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:48.560
People paid money, to acquire water…

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:49.830
I can’t.

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:51.560
I really can’t.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:56.110
And you can’t blame Belle for taking advantage
of a business opportunity… but who are these

00:13:56.110 --> 00:13:57.110
people?

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:58.570
How desperate do you have to be?

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:01.550
So after the bathwater sold out, a number
of things happened.

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:02.960
First, she became a meme.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:03.580
Again.

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:08.060
Everyone was making bathwater videos, some
real, some fake, some drinking the gamer girl

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:12.610
bathwater, my friends Mr. Creepypasta and
Vincent Vena Cava even did a creepypasta narration

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:13.610
video about it.

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:15.380
“You should have seen her.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:16.380
Pink hair.

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:21.800
The tightest little body, those eyes… those
big round anime eyes.

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:23.750
She was like a Hentai drawing come to life.”

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.010
Then the accusations started coming out.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:30.210
A headline was posted to Twitter from an account
posing as the British newspaper, Daily Mail,

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:34.190
which said “Over 50 People Have Reportedly
Contracted Herpes After Drinking Instagram

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:35.950
Star Belle Delphine’s Bathwater.”

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:40.070
Like the fake IRS scandal, some people believed
it, and rumors once again spread, and for

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:43.720
a couple days there it seemed like a fact,
and most of us were wondering if she was gonna

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:44.720
get sued.

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:48.640
And there were actually multiple fake reports
floating around after that.

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:51.220
“And then over the last few days
the ‘news’ broke, and I’m saying ‘news’

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:55.280
because it’s not a real thing, but it broke
that ‘1 person sent to hospital after drinking

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:57.040
internet personality’s bathwater.’”

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:00.510
Some people started to figure out that this
was a hoax on July 9th when fact-checking

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:05.080
website snopes.com verified the information
as false, also citing subsequent tweets from

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:06.860
the Twitter account that started it.

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:11.630
“Between July 7 and July 9, @BakeRises intermittently
tracked how their hoax tweet had caused the

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:15.570
number of their followers to explode, while
another tweet explicitly stated that “It

00:15:15.570 --> 00:15:18.970
seems the best way to grow on Twitter is to
impersonate a company and say things about

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:23.320
a celebrity that legally can be considered
libel and I could potentially be sued for.”

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:26.640
And have wiser words really ever been spoken?

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:27.980
…. Don’t answer that.

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:31.160
The next day Belle cleared everything up when
she officially made a statement putting the

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:34.750
rumors to rest, but I do have to commend her
on the decision to wait one week before

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:36.630
doing so and take all the free press.

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:41.190
She may have gotten the idea for selling bathwater
from the Matt Greoning show, Disenchantment,

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:44.410
where a man known as the decrepit peddler,
has a similar business.

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:47.830
“Me flavored water, fifteen cents!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:50.220
Come taste my knees.

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:51.670
Fifteen cents!”

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:55.700
This could be a coincidence, but I’m thinking
it’s not, because in one of her photos,

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:59.900
she’s wearing a T-shirt referencing a segment
from Matt Groening’s previous show, Futurama.

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:01.640
"Popular.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:02.960
Sl*t Club.”

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:07.460
“Oh my God!

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:09.120
There’s Jake Finkleberg.

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:10.720
He’s so hot!

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:12.640
I wish he wasn’t my brother!”

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.040
“Popular.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:15.680
Sl*t Club.”]

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:16.880
*Laughter*.

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:18.100
That always makes me laugh.

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:19.120
I love Futurama.

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:24.000
Also, I think Belle Delphine could do an awesome
cosplay of Princess Tiabeanie from Disenchantment.

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:25.660
They somehow just kind of look alike.

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:30.340
Eventually, the bathwater came back into stock
at a much higher price point, along with the

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:34.970
$50 gamer girl chewed gum and they $10,000
gamer girl pee.

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:38.000
She actually felt the need to put the disclaimer:
“this is not for drinking.”

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:41.680
*deep breath*

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:44.510
So even as the bathwater thing… evaporated…

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:48.470
Belle continued to gain notoriety when Ethan
Klein came up with a new disgusting product

00:16:48.470 --> 00:16:50.890
idea on his weekly show: The H3 Podcast.

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:56.010
“So what I was proposing to her is
that if you will make a tier award.

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:57.950
Call it Ethan Tier.

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:58.980
Above God.

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:04.089
And the reward is, I will fart in a mason
jar and mail it to you.

00:17:04.089 --> 00:17:08.750
So Ms. Delphine, if we want to call her that,
decided to send Ethan a mystery box, which

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:11.490
he received on July 21st and opened on the
podcast.

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:13.079
“Hello H3H3.

00:17:13.079 --> 00:17:15.250
I hope you got my little box.

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:16.860
And no it’s not my dirty socks.

00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:19.069
It’s a little weird, I must admit.

00:17:19.069 --> 00:17:21.829
But I sent you a bottle of my own ____….

00:17:21.829 --> 00:17:23.699
Oh it’s a poem!”

00:17:23.699 --> 00:17:25.079
It’s not what you’re thinking.

00:17:25.079 --> 00:17:29.460
Ethan and Hila received a jar full of gamer
girl spit along with a flash drive containing

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:31.610
the proof that this is actually her spit.

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:32.610
Oh, and a hat.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:34.029
Honestly, it’s a pretty nice hat.

00:17:34.029 --> 00:17:38.850
The podcast netted 1 million views and the
VOD added another 1.6M. Guess who was featured

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:39.850
on the thumbnails.

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:41.210
It wasn’t Jason Blum.

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:45.509
So that’s basically the peak, I mean there
was this thing in late July or early August

00:17:45.509 --> 00:17:49.389
where she supposedly was hospitalized while
vacationing in Greece, but who knows if that

00:17:49.389 --> 00:17:52.080
actually even happened, but at least she looks
hot in the photo.

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:56.080
Then there was October 7th, where she claimed
to have been arrested, and went on to explain,

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:58.820
“I swear this girl came to my party and
stole my hamster.

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:01.169
I have no idea why, or who the frick does
that?

00:18:01.169 --> 00:18:05.179
I spray painted the heck out of her car and
got arrested, at least I got my hamster back.”

00:18:05.179 --> 00:18:09.630
Not too many big YouTubers fell for it this
time, but if enough small YouTubers talk about

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:13.039
it, she can still get a decent amount of attention
from it, and that’s exactly what happened.

00:18:13.039 --> 00:18:17.529
She’s now in a never-ending cycle of outrageous
PR moves, which are boosted by thirsty gamer

00:18:17.529 --> 00:18:20.639
boys talking about it, which leads to another
outrageous PR move.

00:18:20.639 --> 00:18:24.789
Her net worth is reportedly over 500 grand
and she continues to post weird stuff and

00:18:24.789 --> 00:18:27.019
grow her ever expanding fanbase.

00:18:27.019 --> 00:18:30.450
So that concludes today’s lesson on Horror
History, if you didn’t drop out like Belle

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:33.639
Delphine did then your assignment is to like
this video and let me know in the comments

00:18:33.639 --> 00:18:35.830
who I should cover on the next Horror History.

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:39.450
If you want to see my analysis of other horror
characters then click that playlist on the

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:40.450
left.

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:44.360
Remember to subscribe to CZsWorld for new
horrors every week, ring that deathbelle Delphine

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:47.559
for notifications and I’ll see you in the
next one.

00:18:47.559 --> 00:18:51.220
And if you’re wondering why I did a Horror
History on an e-thot, you might want to check

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:52.649
the date of this upload.

00:18:52.649 --> 00:18:54.289
Assuming we both survive.

